Static scheduler repro for v0.22.1 d02 cadence bug.

Configuration proxy:
- time_step(d01)=18 s
- parent_grid_ratio(d01->d02)=3
- history_interval=20 min
- output_cadence_steps: d01=67, d02=200, d03+=600

Pre-fix scheduler behavior, max_dom=2, 70.2 min / 234 root steps:
  d01: count=3 steps=[67, 134, 201]
  d02: count=1 steps=[600]

Pre-fix scheduler behavior, max_dom=2, 2 h / 400 root steps:
  d01: count=5 steps=[67, 134, 201, 268, 335]
  d02: count=2 steps=[600, 1200]

Post-fix scheduler behavior, max_dom=2, 70.2 min / 234 root steps:
  d01: count=3 steps=[67, 134, 201]
  d02: count=3 steps=[200, 400, 600]

Post-fix scheduler behavior, max_dom=2, 2 h / 400 root steps:
  d01: count=5 steps=[67, 134, 201, 268, 335]
  d02: count=6 steps=[200, 400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200]

Post-fix scheduler behavior, max_dom=9 canary shape, 1 h / 200 root steps:
  d01: count=2 steps=[67, 134]
  d02: count=3 steps=[200, 400, 600]
  d03: count=3 steps=[600, 1200, 1800]
  d04: count=3 steps=[600, 1200, 1800]
  d05: count=3 steps=[600, 1200, 1800]
  d06: count=3 steps=[600, 1200, 1800]
  d07: count=3 steps=[600, 1200, 1800]
